message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "A Residual-Gate Soft Actor-Critic Controller with Small Language Model Planner for Dual-Axis Solar Tracking Systems"
abstract: >-
  Source code for the RG-SAC dual-axis solar tracking controller. An astronomical
  rule-based schedule provides a base orientation, a sun-position model computes the
  correction toward the ideal orientation, and a Soft Actor-Critic agent with automatic
  entropy tuning learns a per-axis gate deciding how much of that correction to apply,
  which retains the classical controller as a structural lower bound. An hourly planner,
  a Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct small language model fine-tuned with LoRA on hindsight-optimal
  targets, sets per-hour authority limits, a movement deadband and the base-pose mode.
